Scope and history
-----------------
The `main` branch, the tags up to `v3.0.0` and the releases up to 3.0.0 are
the previous Omega SREP project. They contain a derivative of SREP 3.93a
(Bulat Ziganshin, "All rights reserved") and are NOT covered by this MIT
license. They are kept for history; their code must not be copied into
OSREP.

Format compatibility
--------------------
OSREP uses the v6 format defined by `spec/format-v6.md`. It reads the v6
archives written by Omega SREP 3.0.0 (the files in
`tests/fixtures/v6/`). It does not implement the SREP v1-v5 formats and
does not contain SREP code.

Third-party components
----------------------
If a public-domain component is reused, its notice stays with it:

- LibTomCrypt (AES, SHA, MD5, SHA-512): "free for all purposes".
- VMAC/VHASH (Ted Krovetz, Wei Dai): public domain.
- LZMA2 (Igor Pavlov): public domain.
- SipHash reference: public domain/CC0 (verify the exact upstream before
  reusing it).

The current `osrep` branch has no implementation code; this list is a
placeholder for phase 1 and will be completed when the C/asm components land.
